	     FIGHTER LINEAGES. Each spans its whole career: the low-level workhorse sits at the
	     bottom of the list, so it only fires before the better skills exist (or in their gaps).
	     ===================================================================================== -->

	<!-- Gladiator line: bank sonic charges, spend them in bursts; barrier when focused.
	     Sonic Focus arrives at 40, so 20-39 is carried by the Warrior (1st class) block above. The line fights with
