	<!-- =============================== ARCHERS (role-split) ===============================
	     Power Shot is the ONLY offensive bow skill from 5 to 35 (Stunning Shot arrives at 36,
	     Double Shot at 40) - so it is the low-level workhorse, retired at 46 once the real
	     rotation exists.

	     The MP gate matters more for archers than for anyone else: a BOW ATTACK ITSELF COSTS MP
	     (weapon mp_consume, charged per shot), and at zero MP the engine refuses to attack at all.
	     So MP is an archer's ammunition - a skill is only worth casting while there is plenty
	     spare to keep shooting with. Power Shot's own 25s reuse already limits it, so the gate is
